 ying the lead against seemingly impossible odds. The result is the ultimat
 e underdog story behind the ultimate underdog movie.\nhttps://www.westnewt
 oncinema.com/movie/i-play-rocky\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city
 /
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/i-play-rocky
