SUMMARY:White Christmas
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Join West Newton Cinema for a musical matinee! Our monthly pick
  will vary from beloved classics to jazz\, from vaudeville to psychedelic 
